WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.106
This is not a reading list — these are the concrete legal tools available to every Canadian citizen right now.

00:00:06.056 --> 00:00:12.454
Section 504 of the Criminal Code allows any person to lay a private prosecution before a Justice of the Peace.

00:00:12.454 --> 00:00:22.954
The Lobbying Act, the Public Servants Disclosure Protection Act, Ethics Commissioner complaint procedures, and Parliamentary petition mechanisms are all documented here with step-by-step instructions.

00:00:22.954 --> 00:00:29.636
When every institutional safeguard has failed, these are the tools the system gave you and hoped you'd never learn to use.
